        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: تخفيض",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "تخفيض — takhfīḍ — \"a price cut; a reduction\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "اشتريت المعطف بتخفيض كبير. ishtaraytu al-miʿṭaf bi-takhfīḍ kabīr. I bought the coat with a big price cut."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The plural takhfīḍāt is the sales."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "تخفيض (takhfīḍ) is built on the native Arabic root kh-f-ḍ, \"to be low; to lower\" (Lane). It is the verbal noun of Form II."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for getting around."
